# Saved webpage artifacts (research input, not skill content).
# Raw HTML carries third-party tracking scripts that trip the security scan
# at CRITICAL severity; scraped datasets carry credential-like vocabulary that
# the scan reads the same way. Keep extracted doctrine as markdown in
# reference/ and research/ instead. Add new artifacts here before saving them
# into research/.
research/*.html
research/*_files/
research/*.json

# Dev-environment install artifacts (not package content).
# `npx skills@latest add ...` writes these.
.agents/
.claude/
skills-lock.json

# Eval harness artifacts + local API key (see evals/BASELINE-v1.md).
eval-workspace/
.eval-key.env
